ly with B: d3-e4 is the most forcing move. This eliminates Black's best-placed piece, maintains material balance, and prevents Black from repositioning the knight to an even better square or creating tactical threats. After the capture, I maintain good piece coordination and can continue developing my remaining pieces.\n\n**Answer:** B: d3-e4"}
